{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>For he will turn away your son from after Me.</b> The gentile's son — when he takes your daughter, he will turn away your son whom your daughter will bear to him from after Me. This teaches us that your daughter's son who comes from a gentile is called 'your son,' but your son's son who comes from a gentile woman is not called 'your son' but 'her son' — for it was not said about his daughter 'do not take, for she will turn away your son from after Me.'"], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:46:14.747030201Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}